      "intervention_exact": "Conditional biallelic excision of the shared ZF-CxxC exon in MS12 Kdm2b-fl/fl; Rosa26-CreERT2 mESCs; 800 nM 4-hydroxytamoxifen for 72 h. Both long and short KDM2B isoforms lose the domain.",
