      "duration": "800 nM 4-hydroxytamoxifen for 72 hours.",
      "system": "MS12-derived Kdm2b conditional-domain-deletion mouse ESCs.",
      "control": "The same conditional line without 4-hydroxytamoxifen; selected loci retaining RING1B are a separate displayed locus class.",
