      "result": "KDM2B and PCGF1 binding to CpG islands falls strongly. At a subset of RING1B targets, RING1B and SUZ12 fall together; selected loci also lose H2AK119ub1, H3K27me3 and PCGF2. Average RNA increases are modest, and RING1B loss correlates weakly with the size of the RNA change.",
      "scope_detail": "ChIP-seq heatmaps cover 3,488 RING1B peaks; the reduced-RING1B subgroup is selected by a greater-than-1.5-fold loss. Figure 6I–J separately shows selected loci with and without RING1B loss.",
